# Purpose: Limits the root build context to API code and the authoritative SQL schema.
**
!services/
!services/api/
!services/api/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/logs
**/uploads
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/tests
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
# services/api/schema is maintained runtime code and must remain in the image.
**/*.docx
**/*.doc
**/*.pdf
**/*.xlsx
**/*.pptx
